# Upload only files used by this Triton image build. In particular, keep model
# checkpoints, DICOM studies, venvs, and the rest of the research workspace out
# of the Cloud Build source archive.
*
!backend/
backend/*
!backend/ai/
backend/ai/*
!backend/ai/**
!inference/
inference/*
!inference/triton/
inference/triton/*
!inference/triton/Dockerfile
!inference/triton/cloudbuild.yaml
!inference/triton/model_repository/
inference/triton/model_repository/*
!inference/triton/model_repository/**
